        "Achieves surface finish Ra 0.4 µm with fine-finish passes — eliminates secondary polishing in many cases",
        "Positioning accuracy ±0.002 mm for high-precision features",
        "Taper cutting up to ±15°/100 mm for complex angled features",
        "Wire diameter range 0.05-0.33 mm enables sharp internal corner radii down to 0.05 mm",
        "Submerged cutting (full immersion) for improved cutting stability and wire cooling",
        "Auto-threading with in-kerf re-threading for multi-feature unattended operation",
        "No heat-affected zone (HAZ) — minimal thermal input to workpiece material"
